 (file descriptor 2) to be  redirected\n\u0026gt;        to the file whose name is the expansion of word.\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt;        There are two formats for redirecting standard output and standard error:\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt;               \u0026amp;\u0026gt;word\n\u0026gt;        and\n\u0026gt;               \u0026gt;\u0026amp;word\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt;        Of the two forms, the first is preferred.  This is semantically equivalent to\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt;               \u0026gt;word 2\u0026gt;\u0026amp;1\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt;        When using the second form, word may not expand to a number or -.  If it does, other redirection operators apply (see Duplicating File\n\u0026gt;        Descriptors below) for compatibility reasons.\nほんとだ．bashのmanにありますね","ts":"1636773869.126400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OXt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"94f8a2cf-d581-4f41-a59d-235248bdaa1b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"同様にパイプでも同じことができて `ffmpeg |\u0026amp; vim -`  するとvimで見れる","ts":"1636772174.125300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pm1W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"39cb741e-f935-4baf-aaf2-80e0258958e1","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`ffmpeg \u0026gt;\u0026amp; help.txt` みたいな感じ","ts":"1636772090.124300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0HL9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3561f02f-a4f9-41c4-862e-0dbc38bfbb4f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"それ、短縮記法として `\u0026gt;\u0026amp;` という物があってべんり","ts":"1636772066.123600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":4,"users":["U0238G3KV8D","U02BDFBM620","U022J550WMQ","U01HXNSLCH5"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RNHk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"447a5dbf-ba25-4305-91c6-ed9ae0734380","type":"message","user":"U02BDFBM620","te